\xi_{\BG}(\ch_i(\gamma))=p_\ast\left(\ch_{i-\lceil\frac{\deg \gamma}{2}\rceil+\dim X}(\BG)q^\ast \gamma\right)\in H^{2i-|\gamma|}(M_\alpha)\,.
